{
 "description": "Read one engagement's canonical history \u2014 proposal \u2192 contract(s) \u2192 milestones/payouts \u2014 for EXACTLY one contractId or proposalId (DEV-2830). Employer-side only: unknown, foreign, candidate-self, and worker-self selectors are one opaque 404; only a missing payments:read is a 403. current.access derives ONLY from participationState ACTIVE/REACTIVATED (ACTIVE | NONE | CONFLICT with every such contract listed \u2014 nothing is picked silently; the proposal's HIRED label is never access). view=current returns every active record (all under CONFLICT) else the latest ended record; view=timeline returns every bounded lineage record plus a chronology of durable stored timestamps only. Rehire links come ONLY from admin_balance.rehire_created audit rows; purpose comes ONLY from work-project evidence (a capped or partial evidence set stays UNSPECIFIED). Bounded (50 contracts, 200 milestones per contract, 500 timeline entries, 50 evidence rows per contract) with explicit truncated flags; no cursor. Requires payments:read scope.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "contractId": {
    "description": "Contract selector (exactly one of contractId / proposalId).",
    "maxLength": 120,
    "minLength": 1,
    "type": "string"
   },
   "proposalId": {
    "description": "Proposal selector (exactly one of contractId / proposalId).",
    "maxLength": 120,
    "minLength": 1,
    "type": "string"
   },
   "view": {
    "description": "Defaults to 'current' (every ACTIVE/REACTIVATED record, else the latest ended record). 'timeline' returns every bounded lineage record plus a chronology of durable stored timestamps.",
    "enum": [
     "current",
     "timeline"
    ],
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "type": "object"
 },
